@title App menu: two panes, search and keys, dark and light
@area Layout
# Lane V2b of the visual redesign (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 5.1).
# The menu words are hidden in Preferences so the mark's menu is the only one;
# F10 opens it.
fresh
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Hidden
wait 6
key Escape
wait 8
shot bar-without-menu-names
key F10
wait 10
expect "About"
expect "Preferences"
shot file-dark
check_layout
key alt+v
wait 6
expect "Reset panel layout"
shot view-dark
key alt+h
wait 6
shot help-dark
text pdf
wait 8
shot search-dark
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 6
key F10
wait 10
shot file-light
key alt+v
wait 6
shot view-light
check_layout
